@@ -317,3 +317,9 @@
 The simulator must settle request registration and callback delivery before
 advancing its timeline. A clock provider alone does not virtualize asyncio
 timers or replace the replay state machine.
+
+Raw record exports preserve the original optional `RequestRecord.end_perf_ns`
+and `recv_start_perf_ns` values. Transport completion can occur after the
+last SSE packet; `metadata.request_end_ns` retains its existing last-packet
+meaning. An absent optional field on an older export means the corresponding
+transport boundary is unavailable, not equal to the last packet.
